the sensor at 0x8000 by the Linux ov5640 driver). Copyright OmniVision Technologies, Inc. No licence is granted by its
author: OmniVision published it only inside its reference driver code. It is redistributed here the same way the
PinePhone Linux distributions do (postmarketOS packages it as license=proprietary from megi's kernel tree), unmodified,
from https://github.com/pmsourcedump/ov5640 at commit 61beaa4eb1ad87ad067cfbe123fbcd0a0cf01246 (SHA-512 in sources.lock).

It is not part of Phorepoc and is not covered by any Phorepoc licence. If you are the copyright holder and want it
removed, contact us through https://github.com/Phorepoc and we will remove it.

The camera works without this file, with fixed focus.
